# SAEA-BENCH-evidfloor — A2-0 item 1: the evidence-arm run-to-run noise floor
# on the FINAL locked shape (evidence np8, canonical fragment). One
# registration, two attempts of the identical arm; the read is the per-sample
# paired WER delta between attempts. Feeds: E-005's significance reads and
# every IC-001 ladder contrast (all are evidence-arm-vs-evidence-arm deltas).
# The bare floor is 0.11 pp; evidence prompts are 5-7x longer with different
# slot occupancy, so the floor must be measured, not assumed.
# run_id:baseline_fragment
SAEA-BENCH-evidfloor:fixed-batch-matched8
